     <p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">稽山鉴水，鼓乐相和；古城千年，青春炽热。近日，“胆剑魂 新时代”2025年绍兴市中小学生文艺汇演圆满落下帷幕。我校精心创排的情景诗朗诵《这束光》在激烈的角逐中脱颖而出，荣获二等奖。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512291433406096.Png" style="width: 3.849306in; height: 2.311111in" alt="202512291433407818.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512291433416910.Png" style="width: 3.849306in; height: 2.3125in" alt="202512291433418677.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512291433410377.Png" style="width: 3.822222in; height: 2.547917in" alt="202512291433412884.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">《这束光》已超越传统诗朗诵的范畴，升华为一部结构完整的情景诗剧。在光与影的交织中，在声与情的共鸣里，每一个环节都经过精心雕琢——剧本的文学深度、演员的角色塑造、灯光的意境烘托、音乐的时空延伸，共同构建出一个立体的艺术空间。当历史的厚重与时代的朝气在作品中对话，舞台上迸发出的不仅是艺术的光彩，更是精神的共鸣。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512291433416384.Png" style="width: 3.634028in; height: 2.422222in" alt="202512291433418951.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512291433416284.Png" style="width: 3.634028in; height: 2.456944in" alt="202512291433417818.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">舞台上三分钟的光芒，往往源于幕后无数个日夜的静默奔赴。对</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参演</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的同学而言，准备《这束光》的过程，恰与期中考试、月考等重要节点交织。学业压力之下，排练时间被压缩在课间、午休与放学后的缝隙里。在压力之下选择担当，在有限条件中创造可能，集体中每个成员都为共同目标主动调适——这一切汇聚的过程，或许比奖项本身更能诠释“光”的真正含义。它源于每一份看似微小的坚持，最终在舞台上凝聚成那束温暖而坚定、能被所有人看见的光芒。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512291433419761.Png" style="width: 3.602083in; height: 2.400694in" alt="202512291433413333.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512291433427784.Png" style="width: 3.6125in; height: 2.408333in" alt="202512291433428919.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512291433424704.Png" style="width: 3.622917in; height: 2.461806in" alt="202512291433420397.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-le